[ 'E1C.C' BIND 'E1C.S' BIND E1C.S CHARS -1 DROP JOIN E1C.S E1C.C 2 COLLECT JOIN [ '(' '[' ')' ']' ] [ 'O' 'O' '(' '[' ] RECORD E1C.C GET E1C.S CHARS -1 GET EQ SELECT ] 'E1C.FSTEP' DEF
[ 'V' BIND 1 0 V [ NIL? ] MAP SELECT G0D.RUNS ] 'E1C.NILRUNS' DEF
[ [ 'price' HAS? ] FILTER 'P' BIND P [ 'qty' GET ] MAP P [ 'price' GET ] MAP MUL 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] 'E1C.REVENUE' DEF
60 'N' BIND 2 0 6 RANGE POW 'P' BIND N P DIV FLOOR 'Q' BIND Q Q 2 DIV FLOOR 2 MUL SUB REVERSE 7 Q [ 0 GT ] FILTER LENGTH SUB DROP [ STR ] MAP JOIN
